<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\静かな雨.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雨1.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭夜2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>The rain was terrible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no thunder, but with the rain this loud, I doubted I'd be able to make out standoffish <STYLE ID="1">Sis's</STYLE> voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "300" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But... will the person on the other end really be <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What if that girl gets in the way again...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But if it's really her, it's a chance that won't come again, a chance to make up with <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I'm being <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="だま">tricked</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
I want to talk to <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hello...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hello!? Are you really okay!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Is it really you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, you're seriously in bad shape, aren't you!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Where are you right now!? Want me to come get you!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I-I'm fine...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Don't lie to me! What was it, the Arata settlement!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You're planning to come?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"These days you can get anywhere if you rent a car!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm happy you'd come, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">right now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I just want to keep listening to your voice, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Okay. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Sorry for going off at you like that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, I'm happy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\雲わすれの夏.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雨2.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
